WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:05.614
Job Agent: how it works
From an empty start to documents for the jobs you choose

00:00:05.614 --> 00:00:09.812
The first page shows the four steps
Search, decide, documents, apply. The step you are at is marked.

00:00:09.812 --> 00:00:12.413
And how your data is handled
Nothing is sent for you. Your CV and documents stay on this computer.

00:00:12.413 --> 00:00:17.125
Before you start: add your CV
My CV and profile. The file stays in your agent folder.

00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:24.145
Your profile fills the templates
Fill in the form once: name, experience, education, skills. Edit it any time.

00:00:24.145 --> 00:00:30.979
1. Type what you look for, and where
Several titles or places: separate them with commas

00:00:30.979 --> 00:00:38.806
Press Search
It asks the job sites and the employers you watch, and keeps what fits

00:00:38.806 --> 00:00:42.327
2. Decide on each job
Employer, place, kind of job, and days left to apply

00:00:42.327 --> 00:00:44.747
Accept the ones you want
They move to Accepted and documents

00:00:44.747 --> 00:00:50.130
Reject the rest, and say why
The reasons teach later searches what to skip

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:53.611
3. Make the documents
A CV and cover letter for each accepted job

00:00:53.611 --> 00:00:56.014
Written for the kind of job and the country
Suggested for you: here experienced, Nordic. Change it if it is wrong.

00:00:56.014 --> 00:01:01.956
Make a template
Built from the job's keywords and your profile. It invents nothing.

00:01:01.956 --> 00:01:06.815
Open the files and finish them
Fill the [brackets] with your own, real details in Word or LibreOffice

00:01:06.815 --> 00:01:10.494
Or a tailored draft from your own CV
"Copy for Claude": paste into any Claude chat, then paste the answer back

00:01:10.494 --> 00:01:14.232
Nothing that was found is lost
Jobs that did not fit your words or places are listed, with why

00:01:14.232 --> 00:01:20.092
4. You apply yourself
Nothing is ever sent for you. Close the tab and the app stops.
